s their own unique way to play and has choosable second skills, which again, changes their playstyle completly.\nYou can loop the game indefinitely, obliterate yourself, go the Boss stage and fight, go into the Void for te \"Endboss\" or do some of the secret Bosses. Its just awesome. \nBtw, even when you have a really nice God-like built, you can still get completly destroyed by the Bosses. That makes it so much fun.\nBest part of all of it is, that you can play it with up to 3 friends. It's just awesome!", "timestamp_created": 1700697151, "timestamp_updated": 1700697151, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151195266", "author": {"steamid": "76561199077145096", "personaname": "M0thWarE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gingy1771/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 7571, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 31, "playtime_at_review": 910, "last_played": 1788837507, "avatar": "b7fbf78e6d2abb73de19ff818cf221d1264cca7f"}, "language": "english", "review": "What the F**K is happening on my screen? 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1700697042, "timestamp_updated": 1700697042, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}